DATA

The touchdown data this project serves, including the fixture database at
tests/fixtures/seasons-2007-2019.db, is derived from nflverse
(https://github.com/nflverse), which publishes it under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The attribution carried by every response of the server:

    Play-by-play data from nflverse (https://github.com/nflverse), licensed
    CC BY 4.0. Processed and reformatted. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
    sponsored by the NFL or any NFL team.

Changes made to the data: it has been processed and reformatted. Play
descriptions are removed, rows are limited to finished games, team
abbreviations are mapped to city names, and touchdown types are relabelled.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the NFL or
any NFL team. Team locations and abbreviations are used for identification
purposes only.
